    "name": "🏥 3eyadaty (عيادتي) — Clinic AI System API",
    "description": "# 🏥 3eyadaty (عيادتي) API Documentation\n\n## Overview\nComplete Enterprise REST API for **3eyadaty**, an autonomous AI-powered clinic management and real-time queue platform built with **FastAPI**, **LangGraph**, **Redis Distributed Locks**, and **PostgreSQL**.\n\n## Environments\n- **Production**: `{{prod_url}}` (https://3eyadaty-api.up.railway.app)\n- **Development**: `{{base_url}}` (http://localhost:8000)\n\n## Authentication & Headers\n- **Public Endpoints** (`/chat`, `/queue/position/...`, `/health`): No token required.\n- **Clinic Protected Endpoints** (`/queue/state/...`, queue operations): Requires header `X-Clinic-Token: {{clinic_token}}`.\n\n## Response Standard\nAll API endpoints return standard JSON responses with descriptive error keys (`slot_taken`, `already_booked_today`, `off_day`, `past_date`, `unauthorized`).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
